2026-10-25T02:36:52.5706020Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6226070Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6253150Z [0m
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6253580Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6254130Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6254330Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6254470Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6254860Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6255090Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6255220Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6255530Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6255670Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6255930Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6256330Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6256700Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6257000Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6257140Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6257270Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6257470Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6257610Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6257940Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6258060Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6258120Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6258240Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6258460Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6258820Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6275290Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6275430Z I will:
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6275560Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6275710Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6276290Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6276700Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6277520Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6277810Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6278090Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6278600Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6278900Z    /var/root
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6296560Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6298040Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6322270Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6323630Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6323970Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6324490Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6324840Z 
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6325140Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-25T02:36:52.6325400Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
